  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You have grown strong enough to more reliably grip onto the fates in your hand. You remove the requirement for @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.FPKTF3qxNMbpoTGx]{Hold Card} from needing to have not Played a card.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.xll3uW0YcIlgdodZ]{Stack the Deck} feat, instead of Holding your Cards when you meet the trigger you can Draw a Card instead.</p>"
